{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is far, then scan. If object is found, then move to it. Finally, take and check properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
